{
  "_": [
    "The relay operator's denylist refusing a SERVER (t14-deny + t14-deny-client), on a THROWAWAY test relay.",
    "a (desktop) owns a server with #general and a voice room; b (desktop), c (iPhone) and d (Android) join;",
    "messages flow. The server id goes on the relay's denylist: within seconds every member shows the red",
