    "x (desktop) asks to join meanwhile: its pending tile reads 'Not available on this relay' and Discard works.",
    "d clears its messages and c leaves, both while refused. The entry is lifted, Try again brings the server",
    "back and messages flow between a, b and d in every direction.",
    "Needs: FRESH identities onboarded onto the test relay, FLEET_RELAY_SSH (+ FLEET_RELAY_SSH_OPTS) naming it.",
    "run: FLEET_BACKEND=macos pwsh -NoProfile -File scripts/fleet.ps1 -Scenario deny_server -Attach -Peers a=q,b=windows:e,c=ios:p,d=android:s,x=windows:f"
  ],
  "peers": ["a", "b", "c", "d", "x"],
